TenderSync pipeline failure: {{ Source }}
<div style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1f2933;max-width:640px">
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#52606d;font-size:13px">TenderSync · {{ Type }}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px"><strong>{{ Source | html.escape }}</strong> needs attention since {{ Date }}.</p>
<pre style="background:#f5f7fa;padding:10px;border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap">{{ Message | html.escape }}</pre>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0"><a href="{{ DashboardUrl }}/admin" style="color:#1d4ed8">Pipeline health</a></p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;color:#7b8794;font-size:12px">Generated automatically from the eTenders portal and your company profile. Verify against the source documents before acting.</p>
</div>
